  "changelog": "Initial release of geoskill-transfer-learning-rs:\n\n- Provides an offline, numpy-equivalent implementation of remote sensing transfer learning (feature extraction + fine-tuned classifier + accuracy evaluation).\n- Uses a fixed filter bank as a \"frozen backbone\" and sklearn classifiers (logistic regression/random forest) as the classification head.\n- Supports both synthetic supervised evaluation and unsupervised clustering for real images.\n- Outputs full-scene classification maps and detailed accuracy/transfer-gain reports.\n- All processing is local and privacy-preserving; no torch/tensorflow dependencies required.",
